      "text": "🚨 ACE UPDATE: On 7/16, in accordance with the Strengthening Customs Enforcement Executive Order, @CBP introduced a new “Inactive for Entry Purposes” status in ACE, which was automatically applied to 4.8 million importer of record accounts that had not filed an entry in over a year. Accounts with this status:\n\n❌ CANNOT submit ACE cargo release or entry summary transactions\n✅ CAN use non-entry functions, like filing drawback claims or securing bonds\n\nLearn how to reactivate an account to participate in entry activities: https://t.co/VK51wRcQTs",
